An input iterator that indicates where a range starts to check for a condition.
last
An input iterator that indicates the end of a range.
pred
The condition to test for. This test is provided by a user-defined predicate function object that defines the condition to be satisfied by the element being searched for. A unary predicate takes a single argument and returns true
or false
.
